libkf5libkleo (4:16.12.3-0ubuntu1) artful; urgency=medium

  [ José Manuel Santamaría Lema ]
  * Update Vcs-Git fields to use https:// instead of git://
  * Pass '-fno-keep-inline-functions' to gcc in the acc test in order to
    avoid possible spurious test failures.
  * Use the debian ABI manager (libkf5libkleo5 -> libkf5libkleo5abi1) due to
    binary incompatible changes; for instance the class DecryptJob provided by
    /usr/include/KF5/libkleo/decryptjob.h is gone.
  * Add libkf5itemmodels-dev to libkf5libkleo-dev depends, fixing the
    acc headers check.
  * New upstream release (16.12.3)

